---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Masthead from '../components/Masthead.astro';
import Colophon from '../components/Colophon.astro';
import Placeholder from '../components/Placeholder.astro';
import { site, showPlaceholders } from '../data/site';
import { signupConfig } from '../data/signup.config';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const providerName = { loops: 'Loops (loops.so)', kit: 'Kit (kit.com)', mock: null }[signupConfig.provider];
---

<Base title={`Privacy policy: ${site.name}`} noindex>
  <Masthead />
  <main id="main" class="section">
    <div class="grid">
      <p class="c-text"><a class="back ui" href={base}>Back to {site.name}</a></p>
      <h1 class="display h2 c-text priv-title">Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="c-text priv-flag">
        {showPlaceholders
          ? <Placeholder label="final privacy policy, reviewed before launch. The text below is a plain-language draft that matches how this page works today." />
          : <span class="priv-lede">A plain-language account of how this page handles your email address.</span>}
      </p>
      <div class="prose c-text priv-body">
        <p><strong>What we collect.</strong> Your email address, if you join the early-access list. Nothing else is asked for.</p>
        <p><strong>What we use it for.</strong> To tell you about early access: {signupConfig.doubleOptIn ? 'a one-time confirmation email, ' : ''}one email when your invitation is ready, and at most one short note a month before then. We don’t sell your address or share it with advertisers.</p>
        <p><strong>Who handles it.</strong> Addresses are stored by our email provider{providerName ? `, ${providerName},` : showPlaceholders ? <Fragment>, <Placeholder label="email provider, e.g. Loops" />,</Fragment> : ''} which sends the emails on our behalf.</p>
        <p><strong>On your device.</strong> This site sets no cookies and runs no analytics or ad trackers. After you sign up, your browser keeps a note of the address in its local storage on this device only, so the form can tell you if you’ve already signed up from this device.</p>
        <p><strong>Your choices.</strong> Every email has an unsubscribe link. To have your address deleted, {site.contactEmail
          ? <Fragment>write to <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>.</Fragment>
          : <Fragment>message us on Instagram, <a href={site.instagram.url} rel="noopener">{site.instagram.handle}</a>.</Fragment>}</p>
        <p><strong>Changes.</strong> If this policy changes, the date below changes too. Last updated {site.policyUpdated}.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Colophon />
</Base>

<style>
  .back { font-size: var(--s-16); }
  .priv-title { margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 4); }
  .priv-flag { margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 2); font-size: var(--s-16); }
  .priv-lede { font-style: italic; color: var(--graphite); }
  .priv-body { margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 4); }
  .priv-body strong { font-weight: 600; }
</style>
